      "writtenOn": "2026-04-16T13:45:56Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Went with approach 1 for now. Ideally the user always draws everything in more or less logical order and there is no re-ordering ever needed, but we should make some attempt to handle arbitrary orders in a way that doesn\u0027t fall over too badly. However, we also don\u0027t want to do a lot of work to figure out the original intent. If that is ever wanted there will need to be some way for the user to explicitly state where they want each draw to end up in the structure tree explicitly.",
